WEBVTT

00:24:27.556 --> 00:24:34.556
explicitly about how should the CIA
change and modify itself,

00:24:34.580 --> 00:24:36.726
what should be the new strategic plan

00:24:36.750 --> 00:24:40.296
now that this focus we had,
the Cold War, is ending.

00:24:40.320 --> 00:24:44.056
So I'm thinking, "I'm on a task force.
Like, this will -- clearly,

00:24:44.080 --> 00:24:46.886
they must want to know
what I really think."

00:24:46.910 --> 00:24:50.846
And so, I would say in the task force
what I really think.

00:24:50.870 --> 00:24:52.036
AG: Carmen was certain

00:24:52.060 --> 00:24:54.573
that this newfangled
thing called the internet

00:24:54.597 --> 00:24:57.482
would transform her job
and her organization.

00:24:57.958 --> 00:24:59.676
And she didn't hide that belief.

00:24:59.700 --> 00:25:03.586
CM: I am convinced that the internet
is going to change everything